    "title": "Full Hands Onikiri 100H",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Onikiri 100H </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This rod born as a shore GT rod, is one of the most pretty and classy rod we've put our hands on.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Apart from the aesthetic aspect, the rod has a great action, pasty to cast a mile with plenty of backbone for some real fight.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The ideal range to really push in the cast is 70 to 120 grams lures.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This rod is also a great choice for trophy Tarpon and Yellowtail from the shore. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Length: 3.00 meters </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Shot weights: 150 grams </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Action: Fast Wire: PE 5~8 </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Weight: 410 grams </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Drag: 13 kg </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Handmade and made in Japan</p>",
